# Old Square store URLs -> the store's new home on booking.shopnowandzen.com
# These paths lived on shopnowandzen.com until the 2026-07-28 cutover, so bookmarks,
# Google's index, and printed/social links still point at them. Square cannot redirect
# across domains, so the new host has to own these. 301 = permanent, passes SEO value.
/product/*      https://booking.shopnowandzen.com/product/:splat    301!
/s/*            https://booking.shopnowandzen.com/s/:splat          301!
/open-workshop  https://booking.shopnowandzen.com/open-workshop     301!
/contact-us     https://booking.shopnowandzen.com/contact-us        301!
/private        https://booking.shopnowandzen.com/private           301!
/diy-kits       https://booking.shopnowandzen.com/diy-kits          301!
/plant-care     https://booking.shopnowandzen.com/plant-care        301!
